{"id":"n58173-1-9","stage":1,"title":"싣다 · 装","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58173-1-9-1","ko":"운반할 물건은 이게 다입니까?","zh":"要搬运的物品就这些吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운반할","meaning":"搬运","explanation":"운반하다：搬运；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"운반하다","audio":"/audio/79eaa415d0da1395d4cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68924","senseId":"1","lemma":"운반하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건은","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이게","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이것：这个；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이것","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44878","senseId":"1","lemma":"이것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다입니까?","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79eaa415d0da1395","term":"운반하다","zh":"搬运","audio":"/audio/79eaa415d0da1395d4cb.mp3","entryId":"68924","definition":"移送东西等。","pronunciation":["운ː반하다"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"e414d84c28c86213","term":"이것","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/e414d84c28c86213ae69.mp3","entryId":"44878","definition":"指代与说话人较近或说话人所想的东西。","pronunciation":["이걷"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/6efd07e3f12b54658d71.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58173-1-9-2","ko":"네, 이거 하나만 더 실으면 됩니다.","zh":"是的，再装这一个就够了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이거","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이거：这个","readings":[{"term":"이거","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71128","senseId":"1","lemma":"이거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나만","meaning":"唯一","explanation":"하나：唯一；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20283","senseId":"3","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실으면","meaning":"装，载","explanation":"싣다：装，载；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"싣다","audio":"/audio/0684cd889a2496873125.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58173","senseId":"1","lemma":"싣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"足够","explanation":"되다：足够；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"19","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"4515223b0fb4ed4e","term":"이거","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/4515223b0fb4ed4e27bf.mp3","entryId":"71128","definition":"指代与说话人较近的、或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이거"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"唯一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20283","definition":"表示唯一，“仅此一个”。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"0684cd889a249687","term":"싣다","zh":"装，载","audio":"/audio/0684cd889a2496873125.mp3","entryId":"58173","definition":"为了搬运某物而将其放在车船和飞机等上。","pronunciation":["싣ː따"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"足够","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"没关系，或没有问题。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/bf357a8df77b9db61dfb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.51,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58173","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.1634,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，再装这一个就够了。","要搬运的物品就这些吗？","送裕敏女儿什么周岁礼物好？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["要搬运的物品就这些吗？","送裕敏女儿什么周岁礼物好？","是的，再装这一个就够了。"],"answer":2}]}
